OL,3,GNEWSAIndoor rower says 'he must declare
OL,4,Aas British' to compete for ranking
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn athlete who previously represented
OL,7,FIreland has said he will only be able
OL,8,Fto compete and receive a ranking in the
OL,9,FBritish Rowing Indoor Championships
OL,10,F(BRIC) if he declares himself as
OL,11,FBritish during the entry process.
OL,13,FDaniel Collins is based in Northern
OL,14,FIreland and competed in last year's
OL,15,Fevent as an Irish entrant.
OL,17,FCollins says this year's event is being
OL,18,Frun concurrently with the World Rowing
OL,19,FIndoor Championships and, as a result,
OL,20,Fentry rules have changed.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
