OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIndoor rower says 'he must declare
OL,4,Aas British' to compete for ranking
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish Rowing said that, to allow for
OL,7,Fboth events to be held concurrently,
OL,8,Fthe BRIC "will run as a national title
OL,9,Fevent for British athletes, while the
OL,10,FWorld Rowing Indoor Championships
OL,11,F(WRICH) is open to athletes of all
OL,12,Fnationalities".
